            </div>
        </section>

        <!-- ===== RIGHT: INSIGHTS PANEL (cols 10-12) ===== -->
        <aside class="lg:col-span-3">
            <div class="bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-md p-5 h-full">
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900">4. Insights Panel</h3>
                <h4 class="mt-3 mb-4 text-sm font-semibold text-slate-700">Key Observations</h4>
                <ul class="space-y-6 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed list-disc pl-5">
                    <li>3mm Cover Drilling shows consistent upward trend reaching 85%.</li>
                    <li>8mm Compound Application has highest weekly improvement, peaking at 86%.</li>
                    <li>Overall efficiency improved from 44% &rarr; 70% across the period.</li>
                    <li>Remaining manpower distribution shows 59% concentration in 3mm Compound Application.</li>
                </ul>
            </div>
        </aside>

        <!-- ===== BOTTOM: PROCESS-LEVEL EFFICIENCY (full width of left + middle) ===== -->
        <section class="lg:col-span-9 space-y-3">
            <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-slate-900 uppercase">3. Process-Level Efficiency</h3>
            <div class="overflow-x-auto bg-white border border-slate-300 rounded-md">
                <table class="w-full text-sm text-center whitespace-nowrap">
                    <thead class="bg-slate-100 text-slate-700">
                        <tr>
                            <th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-semibold">Process</th>
